WEBVTT

00:00:11.440 --> 00:00:13.780
<b>Curry-Flavored
Crunchy Corn Snack</b>

00:00:28.500 --> 00:00:31.000
I can't take this... any more.

00:00:33.270 --> 00:00:36.020
Is there something wrong, master?

00:00:36.460 --> 00:00:37.690
<i>This feeling...</i>

00:00:38.250 --> 00:00:40.080
<i>It's just like with Tashiro!</i>

00:00:40.080 --> 00:00:42.240
You need to use the restroom?

00:00:42.240 --> 00:00:46.500
Then, you will find a convenience 
store just past the corner!

00:00:46.890 --> 00:00:47.900
<i>That way!</i>

00:02:22.160 --> 00:02:26.870
<b>Nineteenth Haunting 
Let's Communication</b>

00:02:22.190 --> 00:02:24.930
<i>What can I do?</i>

00:02:25.330 --> 00:02:27.460
<i>But now that I've seen her,</i>

00:02:27.460 --> 00:02:28.670
<i>I can't ignore her!</i>

00:02:29.780 --> 00:02:30.830
<i>There she is.</i>

00:02:31.200 --> 00:02:33.450
Oh, that girl...

00:02:33.450 --> 00:02:35.970
She's trying to use magic to fly.

00:02:35.970 --> 00:02:36.990
No!

00:02:36.990 --> 00:02:38.300
What are you doing?

00:02:42.030 --> 00:02:45.420
S-Standing there is dangerous.

00:02:45.420 --> 00:02:47.460
It's none of your business.

00:02:47.890 --> 00:02:51.690
Sure, but... Um, well...

00:02:51.690 --> 00:02:53.060
Um...

00:02:53.060 --> 00:02:55.480
I'm just sick of it all!

00:02:55.480 --> 00:02:57.490
Home, school, everything.

00:02:57.490 --> 00:02:59.760
Who cares what I do?

00:02:59.760 --> 00:03:01.390
Do I bother anyone?

00:03:01.390 --> 00:03:03.410
You guys always bitch at me,

00:03:03.410 --> 00:03:05.570
but you never listen to me.

00:03:05.570 --> 00:03:07.100
It isn't fair!

00:03:07.360 --> 00:03:10.290
I don't even want to do it...

00:03:11.160 --> 00:03:13.370
I'm just sick of everything!

00:03:17.060 --> 00:03:18.830
I've made my choice...

00:03:18.830 --> 00:03:21.350
There's no fun in living.

00:03:22.360 --> 00:03:23.930
It's all stupid.

00:03:25.000 --> 00:03:25.640
Wait!

00:03:27.390 --> 00:03:28.560
I won't make it—

00:03:28.560 --> 00:03:30.880
Hello, miss!

00:03:32.700 --> 00:03:35.170
After seeing this beautiful sunset,

00:03:35.170 --> 00:03:38.450
I understand why you would 
feel a sudden urge to fly.

00:03:38.450 --> 00:03:41.810
But it seems you are not a student of magic.

00:03:41.810 --> 00:03:43.040
I see!

00:03:43.040 --> 00:03:44.980
Then, it was suicide?

00:03:44.980 --> 00:03:47.610
I cannot say I approve...

00:03:47.610 --> 00:03:50.970
Hell is filled with soul-eating demons.

00:03:50.970 --> 00:03:55.540
Do you wish to suffer eternal 
pain after your death?

00:03:56.720 --> 00:03:58.750
A scary monster!

00:03:58.970 --> 00:03:59.880
No!

00:03:59.890 --> 00:04:01.620
Daddy! Mommy!

00:04:01.910 --> 00:04:03.720
Oh, dear...

00:04:05.670 --> 00:04:07.630
And that's what happened...

00:04:08.770 --> 00:04:11.800
Fool-kun, nice job.

00:04:11.800 --> 00:04:14.310
So you are useful, Petit.

00:04:14.310 --> 00:04:15.950
Now, master,

00:04:15.950 --> 00:04:19.780
please give me words of praise, as well!

00:04:19.780 --> 00:04:21.190
And you know what's really shocking?

00:04:21.530 --> 00:04:23.940
She's still in sixth grade.

00:04:23.940 --> 00:04:26.050
Master, you meanie!

00:04:26.610 --> 00:04:29.210
She's one busy sixth grader.

00:04:29.210 --> 00:04:32.310
You're here again, like you 
belong here, Hase.

00:04:32.310 --> 00:04:36.790
The Yokai Apartments, on Sunday, 
is my relaxation spot.

00:04:36.790 --> 00:04:40.270
But I don't get sixth graders these days.

00:04:40.270 --> 00:04:42.540
Trying to kill themselves like that...

00:04:42.540 --> 00:04:48.310
To her, that moment was very serious.

00:04:49.500 --> 00:04:53.130
Thinking back, she'll realize 
what she did was stupid.

00:04:53.560 --> 00:04:55.320
But it was just a moment...

00:04:55.800 --> 00:04:59.780
What you think in that moment is everything.

00:04:59.970 --> 00:05:02.190
The devil makes you do it.

00:05:03.970 --> 00:05:07.580
The problem is when you're unable to 
control yourself for that moment.

00:05:09.990 --> 00:05:12.870
Well, I'm glad you saved her.

00:05:12.870 --> 00:05:14.080
That's right!

00:05:14.080 --> 00:05:15.650
One wrong move,

00:05:15.650 --> 00:05:18.760
and she might have ended up here!

00:05:20.060 --> 00:05:22.660
That wouldn't have been good.

00:05:23.160 --> 00:05:26.090
Kuri, you smell like the sun...

00:05:26.090 --> 00:05:27.220
Trouble!

00:05:27.220 --> 00:05:29.510
Yushi-kun, the cops called!

00:05:31.710 --> 00:05:32.840
Yes.

00:05:32.840 --> 00:05:34.030
All right.

00:05:34.400 --> 00:05:35.770
I'll be there soon.

00:05:37.450 --> 00:05:39.770
The girl I was telling you about

00:05:39.770 --> 00:05:42.930
went to the police because 
she wanted to thank me.

00:05:43.820 --> 00:05:45.770
That's nice of her.

00:05:45.770 --> 00:05:47.910
So, you're going?

00:05:47.910 --> 00:05:48.780
Yes.

00:05:48.780 --> 00:05:50.090
I don't know...

00:05:50.090 --> 00:05:50.890
Yeah.

00:05:51.120 --> 00:05:56.120
When someone who tried to 
kill themselves is saved,

00:05:56.120 --> 00:06:01.670
they sometimes start to depend on the 
one who saved them for everything.

00:06:01.670 --> 00:06:03.050
Everything?

00:06:03.050 --> 00:06:06.030
Her life, her soul...

00:06:06.030 --> 00:06:07.800
And her body.

00:06:08.040 --> 00:06:10.410
Th-That's an exaggeration...

00:06:10.930 --> 00:06:13.120
I hope it is.

00:06:14.430 --> 00:06:18.600
<b>Takanodai Higashi Police Department</b>

00:06:17.340 --> 00:06:18.600
<i>I guess I'll go.</i>

00:06:18.870 --> 00:06:21.640
Thank so you much for what you did!

00:06:21.640 --> 00:06:23.010
I'm Yumi Asada.

00:06:23.020 --> 00:06:25.030
<b>Yumi Asada 
Nice to meet you all!</b>

00:06:23.440 --> 00:06:25.010
This is my card.

00:06:25.520 --> 00:06:27.470
I'm Yushi Inaba.

00:06:27.470 --> 00:06:29.230
And I don't need the card.

00:06:29.950 --> 00:06:31.190
Why? Why?

00:06:31.190 --> 00:06:32.630
Why not?

00:06:32.320 --> 00:06:34.910
<b>Yumi</b>

00:06:32.630 --> 00:06:35.410
You need my ID and stuff to reach me!

00:06:35.410 --> 00:06:36.960
I don't have a smart phone...

00:06:36.960 --> 00:06:39.970
I've never met someone who didn't. 
Why don't you have one?

00:06:39.970 --> 00:06:42.250
I'd die without mine!

00:06:42.250 --> 00:06:43.330
That's weird...

00:06:43.340 --> 00:06:48.340
<b>Showa</b>

00:06:44.050 --> 00:06:46.970
Showa? Were you born in the Showa period?

00:06:46.970 --> 00:06:48.340
It was Heisei.

00:06:48.340 --> 00:06:50.970
Or do you not have friends?

00:06:51.550 --> 00:06:54.170
Sorry! I shouldn't ask that, right?

00:06:55.120 --> 00:06:58.160
Hey, aren't "Yushi-kun" and 
"Yumi-chan" similar?

00:06:58.160 --> 00:07:01.300
<i>I can't take any more!</i>

00:07:01.300 --> 00:07:03.660
Really, thank you so much.

00:07:05.200 --> 00:07:06.810
I'm sorry.

00:07:06.810 --> 00:07:07.950
Okay.

00:07:08.340 --> 00:07:09.480
Don't do it again.

00:07:09.730 --> 00:07:10.690
Yes.

00:07:11.140 --> 00:07:14.650
Um, would you listen to me for a bit?

00:07:14.660 --> 00:07:20.080
<b>Driver's License Testing</b>

00:07:16.360 --> 00:07:20.070
Honestly, I don't think I wanted to die.

00:07:20.920 --> 00:07:21.820
But...

00:07:22.430 --> 00:07:24.490
I made some new friends.

00:07:24.490 --> 00:07:27.420
And at first, it was so much fun.

00:07:27.750 --> 00:07:31.000
But I started to not fit in.

00:07:31.400 --> 00:07:32.340
And...

00:07:32.950 --> 00:07:35.140
They tried to make me do bad things.

00:07:35.430 --> 00:07:37.300
I couldn't do them anymore.

00:07:37.300 --> 00:07:39.770
And then, Mom got super mad.

00:07:39.770 --> 00:07:41.730
I didn't even do anything wrong.

00:07:41.730 --> 00:07:44.930
We fought because I didn't
know why she got so mad.

00:07:44.930 --> 00:07:46.610
She even tried to take my phone.

00:07:46.610 --> 00:07:48.860
She yelled at me, and then...

00:07:49.850 --> 00:07:53.520
I think I just didn't know what to do...

00:07:53.850 --> 00:07:55.110
<i>I see.</i>

00:07:55.700 --> 00:07:58.360
<i>She's just unbalanced.</i>

00:07:59.500 --> 00:08:01.230
<i>Her body's grown up,</i>

00:08:01.230 --> 00:08:03.690
<i>and she thinks she can do different things.</i>

00:08:04.080 --> 00:08:07.280
<i>But her mind is still a child's mind,</i>

00:08:07.280 --> 00:08:08.340
<i>so she gets upset.</i>

00:08:08.740 --> 00:08:11.110
<i>I'm sure everyone walks that path.</i>

00:08:11.780 --> 00:08:15.140
<i>For her, it was just a bit soon. And extreme.</i>

00:08:15.410 --> 00:08:18.190
Why did I decide to die?

00:08:18.530 --> 00:08:20.850
It's so scary...

00:08:21.220 --> 00:08:27.150
To her, that moment was very serious.

00:08:27.420 --> 00:08:30.710
I think, sometimes, everyone wants to die.

00:08:30.710 --> 00:08:31.700
Really?

00:08:32.010 --> 00:08:33.480
You, too?

00:08:33.480 --> 00:08:34.630
I...

00:08:35.480 --> 00:08:38.600
I'm not allowed to want that.

00:08:38.600 --> 00:08:39.890
Why?

00:08:40.280 --> 00:08:42.410
Because my parents died before me.

00:08:44.080 --> 00:08:44.930
I...

00:08:44.080 --> 00:08:45.250
<b>Driver's License Testing</b>

00:08:45.470 --> 00:08:46.950
I'm sorry.

00:08:49.510 --> 00:08:53.220
When your parents are angry, 
it means they're worried.

00:08:51.170 --> 00:09:01.060
<b>Driver's License Testing</b>

00:08:53.740 --> 00:08:56.200
They care about you.

00:08:56.200 --> 00:08:59.400
So take better care of yourself.

00:09:03.610 --> 00:09:05.230
Hey! Again?!

00:09:06.320 --> 00:09:08.890
No... It's nothing!

00:09:08.900 --> 00:09:11.820
<b>Takanodai Higashi Police Department</b>

00:09:09.130 --> 00:09:11.810
Stop crying!

00:09:12.810 --> 00:09:15.530
<i>What... am I doing?</i>

00:09:16.020 --> 00:09:17.790
Sorry for crying!

00:09:19.580 --> 00:09:22.360
I feel kind of embarrassed 
without my makeup.

00:09:22.370 --> 00:09:37.050
<b>Safety Association                               Driver's License Testing</b>

00:09:22.550 --> 00:09:25.810
Yeah? I think you look better without it.

00:09:26.680 --> 00:09:29.020
You like me better this way?

00:09:29.020 --> 00:09:30.760
You're still in sixth grade.

00:09:30.760 --> 00:09:35.380
If you use it now, how much 
will you wear as an adult?

00:09:35.380 --> 00:09:37.060
I... I see.

00:09:37.290 --> 00:09:39.470
Anyway, I'm leaving.

00:09:40.340 --> 00:09:41.640
You are?!

00:09:42.020 --> 00:09:43.470
I have work.

00:09:43.850 --> 00:09:44.550
Bye.

00:09:46.580 --> 00:09:48.830
Yushi-kun, see you later!

00:09:54.940 --> 00:09:56.270
Yushi-kun...

00:09:57.550 --> 00:09:58.610
I came to see you.

00:09:58.610 --> 00:10:00.120
Come on, now...

00:10:01.150 --> 00:10:02.240
Yushi-kun!

00:10:02.610 --> 00:10:04.030
Yushi-kun!

00:10:04.410 --> 00:10:06.160
Yushi-kun!

00:10:06.160 --> 00:10:07.880
Youth, chirp.

00:10:07.880 --> 00:10:09.580
A blue spring, chirp.

00:10:09.580 --> 00:10:11.360
Bittersweet, chirp.

00:10:11.360 --> 00:10:12.840
Chirpity-chirp! Chirp!

00:10:12.840 --> 00:10:15.550
She's totally reliant on you, huh?

00:10:15.550 --> 00:10:17.930
Ended up just like we said, huh?

00:10:19.490 --> 00:10:21.340
You look like you're having fun.

00:10:24.390 --> 00:10:26.220
She isn't a bad girl, though...

00:10:26.800 --> 00:10:30.780
I sensed a very pure aura coming from her!

00:10:30.780 --> 00:10:33.320
That is probably why it is easily affected.

00:10:33.320 --> 00:10:35.250
Easily affected, huh?

00:10:35.550 --> 00:10:36.400
Yeah,

00:10:37.330 --> 00:10:39.330
she wasn't wearing makeup.

00:10:40.380 --> 00:10:41.480
Yushi-kun!

00:10:42.900 --> 00:10:46.410
Were you just talking to someone?

00:10:46.410 --> 00:10:48.580
No! Nobody's here!

00:10:49.890 --> 00:10:51.600
Well, it doesn't matter.

00:10:51.600 --> 00:10:53.970
Hey, are you free today?

00:10:53.970 --> 00:10:55.920
Want to hang out somewhere?

00:10:56.780 --> 00:10:58.030
Sorry.

00:10:58.030 --> 00:10:59.770
I'm busy today.

00:11:00.560 --> 00:11:01.570
Where are you going?

00:11:01.570 --> 00:11:03.130
I want to go, too!

00:11:07.430 --> 00:11:08.430
Fine.

00:11:08.430 --> 00:11:09.460
Really?

00:11:09.460 --> 00:11:10.390
Thanks.

00:11:10.390 --> 00:11:11.680
Hooray!

00:11:11.680 --> 00:11:12.710
But!

00:11:12.710 --> 00:11:14.020
Wh-What?

00:11:14.240 --> 00:11:15.440
Ditch those clothes.

00:11:15.690 --> 00:11:16.510
The shoes, too!

00:11:17.140 --> 00:11:17.940
They're no good?

00:11:17.940 --> 00:11:20.380
No good! Be polite there!

00:11:20.380 --> 00:11:23.760
Introduce yourself properly, 
and listen to what people say!

00:11:23.760 --> 00:11:25.150
Speak clearly!

00:11:25.150 --> 00:11:27.670
And don't forget that you're coming...

00:11:27.670 --> 00:11:29.020
Cause! I'm!

00:11:29.020 --> 00:11:30.750
Letting! You!

00:11:30.750 --> 00:11:32.190
S-Sure...

00:11:32.190 --> 00:11:33.460
The answer is "Yes"!

00:11:33.460 --> 00:11:34.700
Y-Yes!

00:11:34.700 --> 00:11:37.390
And don't hand out those business cards.

00:11:37.390 --> 00:11:38.240
That's all.

00:11:38.240 --> 00:11:40.240
You'd better do all of that. Got it?

00:11:40.240 --> 00:11:41.540
Yes!

00:11:55.500 --> 00:11:56.260
Well?

00:11:56.260 --> 00:11:57.690
Looks fine.

00:11:59.320 --> 00:12:01.590
It's all foreigners...

00:12:01.590 --> 00:12:03.960
It's the Foreigners Club party, after all.

00:12:04.200 --> 00:12:06.320
Why are you attending?

00:12:06.670 --> 00:12:09.120
I'm part of the English Conversation Club.

00:12:09.120 --> 00:12:12.980
And so, we'll be dubbing in English here.

00:12:13.280 --> 00:12:14.160
Okay?

00:12:14.160 --> 00:12:15.870
O-Okay.

00:12:16.180 --> 00:12:18.560
Yoo-hoo! Inaba!

00:12:18.560 --> 00:12:20.460
Want some meat? Meat!

00:12:21.290 --> 00:12:22.280
Tashiro...

00:12:22.280 --> 00:12:23.170
Go on.

00:12:23.170 --> 00:12:25.130
H-Hello.

00:12:25.130 --> 00:12:26.660
I'm Yumi Asada.

00:12:26.660 --> 00:12:28.690
Oh, you're the one?

00:12:28.690 --> 00:12:30.460
Inaba's told me all about you.

00:12:30.460 --> 00:12:33.090
Since you're Yumi-chan, 
I'll call you "Yu-chan."

00:12:33.090 --> 00:12:35.730
You can call me "Tako-nee"!

00:12:36.960 --> 00:12:39.100
Okay, Tako-neesan.

00:12:39.100 --> 00:12:40.350
Hi, Yushi.

00:12:41.140 --> 00:12:42.110
Welcome.

00:12:42.440 --> 00:12:43.420
George!

00:12:44.510 --> 00:12:46.140
He's the boss of this club.

00:12:47.070 --> 00:12:49.190
I'm Yumi Asada...

00:12:50.160 --> 00:12:52.120
Relax. Relax.

00:12:52.400 --> 00:12:54.690
If you don't understand something, ask.

00:12:54.690 --> 00:12:56.780
Now, let's party.

00:12:57.730 --> 00:12:58.470
Okay!

00:12:58.780 --> 00:13:00.940
Yumi? Not hungry?

00:13:02.330 --> 00:13:03.520
Um...

00:13:03.520 --> 00:13:05.350
He asked if you're hungry.

00:13:06.040 --> 00:13:08.260
I am hungry! Hungry!

00:13:08.260 --> 00:13:10.250
Okay, follow me.

00:13:11.380 --> 00:13:13.530
Um... Um...

00:13:13.890 --> 00:13:15.480
Be polite.

00:13:15.480 --> 00:13:17.020
O-Okay.

00:13:17.990 --> 00:13:20.440
My name is Asada Yumi.

00:13:20.700 --> 00:13:23.860
Or is it Yumi Asada?

00:13:23.860 --> 00:13:26.470
Yumi, nice to meet you.

00:13:26.930 --> 00:13:28.750
Welcome, Yumi.

00:13:28.750 --> 00:13:30.440
Enjoy yourself.

00:13:31.200 --> 00:13:32.040
Okay!

00:13:32.040 --> 00:13:34.360
I mean... Y-Yes!

00:13:34.930 --> 00:13:36.850
So that's the girl?

00:13:36.850 --> 00:13:39.610
Oh, club president...

00:13:39.610 --> 00:13:41.330
Thanks for letting me bring her.

00:13:41.330 --> 00:13:42.720
It's fine.

00:13:42.720 --> 00:13:47.830
George said, "A party's more 
fun with more people."

00:13:47.830 --> 00:13:49.500
Thank you very much.

00:13:49.500 --> 00:13:53.550
By the way, when are we doing our recording?

00:13:53.550 --> 00:13:54.600
Well,

00:13:54.600 --> 00:13:57.350
the star, Mamiya, isn't here...

00:13:57.810 --> 00:14:00.700
There's been no word, so I 
don't know what to do.

00:14:01.990 --> 00:14:03.190
Speak of the devil.

00:14:03.190 --> 00:14:05.240
Hello? Where are you?

00:14:06.310 --> 00:14:07.490
No way!

00:14:07.490 --> 00:14:09.110
I've got a bad feeling.

00:14:09.110 --> 00:14:10.520
Fine.

00:14:10.520 --> 00:14:13.560
We'll work something out, so take care.

00:14:16.020 --> 00:14:17.350
Inaba!

00:14:17.350 --> 00:14:18.530
What?

00:14:18.540 --> 00:14:21.210
<b>Nata de Coco Quest</b>

00:14:18.800 --> 00:14:21.210
Mamiya's sick and can't come.

00:14:21.530 --> 00:14:23.190
Can you do it?

00:14:24.450 --> 00:14:26.050
Please get ready!

00:14:31.510 --> 00:14:32.770
I got it!

00:14:32.760 --> 00:14:35.470
<b>Nata de Coco Quest</b>

00:14:33.060 --> 00:14:34.810
I'm counting on you.

00:14:38.760 --> 00:14:41.070
Ladies and gentlemen!

00:14:41.070 --> 00:14:43.320
Joutou English Club presents...

00:14:47.780 --> 00:14:49.070
Yushi-kun?

00:14:52.780 --> 00:14:53.910
Oh, no!

00:14:53.910 --> 00:14:56.200
Princess Panna Cotta!

00:15:00.770 --> 00:15:03.530
Help me, Nata de Coco!

00:15:02.210 --> 00:15:04.290
Oh, no!

00:15:09.270 --> 00:15:11.470
Nothing's denting it...

00:15:11.470 --> 00:15:13.140
You can't beat me.

00:15:13.140 --> 00:15:14.190
Never!

00:15:14.190 --> 00:15:15.400
God...

00:15:17.840 --> 00:15:21.400
I will give you half of this world.

00:15:21.750 --> 00:15:24.600
No! I'll bash you down!

00:15:26.330 --> 00:15:28.070
You fool!

00:15:30.780 --> 00:15:33.160
<b>The End</b>

00:15:51.550 --> 00:15:53.710
That was good stuff, Cap.

00:15:53.710 --> 00:15:55.220
Thank you, George.

00:15:55.220 --> 00:15:57.490
I love this anime!

00:15:57.490 --> 00:15:59.890
You do? I'm glad.

00:16:00.150 --> 00:16:02.780
You were a little nervous, Yushi.

00:16:03.730 --> 00:16:05.510
It was really sudden.

00:16:05.510 --> 00:16:08.130
No excuses, Yushi.

00:16:08.130 --> 00:16:09.910
Sorry, George.

00:16:20.710 --> 00:16:23.780
Thank you for inviting me today.

00:16:23.780 --> 00:16:26.380
You are welcome anytime.

00:16:26.970 --> 00:16:29.210
Did she do anything rude?

00:16:30.360 --> 00:16:32.370
She was a very good girl.

00:16:32.370 --> 00:16:34.830
She introduced herself properly, too.

00:16:35.130 --> 00:16:36.100
Right, Yumi?

00:16:36.100 --> 00:16:37.600
Yes!

00:16:37.870 --> 00:16:40.880
Thank you very much for having me today!

00:16:45.140 --> 00:16:48.760
Yushi-kun, thank you for 
bringing me with you today.

00:16:50.180 --> 00:16:51.570
And...

00:16:53.520 --> 00:16:56.880
For also telling me to be polite.

00:16:57.700 --> 00:17:00.210
I realized that everyone accepted me

00:17:00.210 --> 00:17:03.340
because of what you told me to do.

00:17:03.920 --> 00:17:06.330
Being polite is important, right?

00:17:06.720 --> 00:17:08.110
Yeah.

00:17:08.110 --> 00:17:10.180
The old me would've—

00:17:10.180 --> 00:17:12.100
Oh, Yumi-chan!

00:17:12.550 --> 00:17:14.650
What are you doing here?

00:17:14.650 --> 00:17:16.600
Who's this?

00:17:16.600 --> 00:17:17.880
Your boyfriend?

00:17:17.880 --> 00:17:20.210
He looks poor!

00:17:22.760 --> 00:17:23.920
These are...

00:17:24.150 --> 00:17:25.160
Yeah.

00:17:25.160 --> 00:17:26.510
My friends.

00:17:26.510 --> 00:17:28.310
Oh, yeah!

00:17:28.310 --> 00:17:30.000
We're going to hang out.

00:17:30.000 --> 00:17:31.160
You'll come, right?

00:17:31.160 --> 00:17:33.930
What are you going to do?

00:17:33.930 --> 00:17:35.820
What else?

00:17:35.820 --> 00:17:38.480
I'm running out of foundation...

00:17:38.480 --> 00:17:40.700
I want a new color.

00:17:40.700 --> 00:17:42.410
Let's get everything.

00:17:42.740 --> 00:17:45.290
<i>"Hanging out"? These guys...</i>

00:17:45.610 --> 00:17:46.670
And you know,

00:17:46.670 --> 00:17:49.960
we haven't forgotten how you left us.

00:17:49.960 --> 00:17:52.320
If you run, you know what happens, right?

00:17:53.210 --> 00:17:54.620
Hey, enough—

00:17:54.620 --> 00:17:57.430
No!

00:17:57.430 --> 00:17:58.590
Huh?

00:17:58.590 --> 00:18:03.700
Today, I learned a lot of 
things I hadn't known.

00:18:03.700 --> 00:18:06.010
Stories from all over the world.

00:18:06.560 --> 00:18:12.650
And then, I realized that what I've 
been doing is really stupid!

00:18:12.650 --> 00:18:13.690
You—

00:18:13.690 --> 00:18:15.120
Forcing myself to wear makeup,

00:18:15.120 --> 00:18:17.390
trying to stand out with flashy clothes,

00:18:17.390 --> 00:18:18.640
shoplifting!

00:18:18.640 --> 00:18:21.050
Grownups don't act like that!

00:18:21.050 --> 00:18:23.280
Are you saying we're kids?

00:18:23.280 --> 00:18:24.760
I'm saying you're stupid!

00:18:25.500 --> 00:18:28.150
I want to be a grownup...

00:18:28.150 --> 00:18:31.040
You guys shouldn't do this, either.

00:18:31.040 --> 00:18:33.230
What's her problem? She's ticking me off!

00:18:33.230 --> 00:18:35.430
Who do you think you are?

00:18:35.430 --> 00:18:37.920
We were nice enough to 
let you hang out with us!

00:18:37.920 --> 00:18:40.170
You won't get away with this!

00:18:40.580 --> 00:18:42.990
Yumi, close your eyes.

00:18:43.730 --> 00:18:44.470
Okay.

00:18:45.040 --> 00:18:46.860
Hold back your power...

00:18:48.970 --> 00:18:50.040
Brondis!

00:18:57.400 --> 00:18:59.610
Splendid, master.

00:18:59.610 --> 00:19:03.280
You controlled Brondis's power perfectly!

00:19:03.280 --> 00:19:04.400
Yeah...

00:19:04.400 --> 00:19:06.460
I'm glad it worked.

00:19:06.880 --> 00:19:07.900
What was that?

00:19:08.760 --> 00:19:10.070
I don't know!

00:19:10.070 --> 00:19:12.220
Maybe lightning?

00:19:13.490 --> 00:19:15.370
Okay, I'll be going.

00:19:15.970 --> 00:19:17.880
U-Um...

00:19:17.880 --> 00:19:19.150
What is it?

00:19:19.490 --> 00:19:20.730
I'm sorry!

00:19:20.730 --> 00:19:24.270
Starting tomorrow, I won't be 
able to come and see you!

00:19:25.100 --> 00:19:27.890
I found out what I want to do!

00:19:28.330 --> 00:19:30.980
So I'll be busy...

00:19:30.980 --> 00:19:32.050
Sorry.

00:19:32.050 --> 00:19:35.890
<i>But I never asked her to come.</i>

00:19:36.440 --> 00:19:38.530
I see. That's great.

00:19:39.070 --> 00:19:41.460
May I ask what you want to do?

00:19:41.460 --> 00:19:42.660
English conversation!

00:19:43.020 --> 00:19:45.330
Today, when I heard everyone,

00:19:45.330 --> 00:19:47.420
I decided I wanted to hear more.

00:19:47.420 --> 00:19:49.520
So I want to learn English.

00:19:49.520 --> 00:19:51.870
No, I'm going to do it!

00:19:52.170 --> 00:19:52.980
Right.

00:19:52.980 --> 00:19:54.040
Good luck.

00:19:54.040 --> 00:19:54.990
Thanks.

00:19:54.990 --> 00:19:56.060
Bye.

00:19:57.910 --> 00:19:59.410
Oh, right...

00:20:00.060 --> 00:20:02.840
Tell your friend the bird "thanks," too!

00:20:04.720 --> 00:20:06.070
Bye-bye!

00:20:06.700 --> 00:20:09.940
Clever girl, isn't she?

00:20:09.940 --> 00:20:12.600
Girls are scary, even when they're tiny...

00:20:13.390 --> 00:20:15.590
Mommy, um...

00:20:16.100 --> 00:20:17.380
I'm sorry!

00:20:17.900 --> 00:20:18.910
And...

00:20:19.900 --> 00:20:24.260
I learned what I want to do!

00:20:25.080 --> 00:20:27.570
She starts out wanting to kill herself,

00:20:27.570 --> 00:20:30.120
hangs out with you, and now she's 
into English conversation?

00:20:30.360 --> 00:20:33.130
That's some power she's got.

00:20:33.130 --> 00:20:34.050
Yeah...

00:20:34.050 --> 00:20:36.440
Honestly, it was overwhelming.

00:20:37.780 --> 00:20:40.320
The power of a child, huh?

00:20:40.320 --> 00:20:42.170
The power of a child?

00:20:42.170 --> 00:20:44.200
They learn about a new world,

00:20:44.200 --> 00:20:47.570
and if it interests them, 
they head straight for it.

00:20:47.570 --> 00:20:49.530
Without looking back.

00:20:49.530 --> 00:20:52.050
That can be dangerous, though.

00:20:52.050 --> 00:20:54.400
They can't tell good from evil.

00:20:57.560 --> 00:20:59.490
That's right...

00:21:01.460 --> 00:21:04.700
I'm glad it was you who stopped 
her from committing suicide.

00:21:04.700 --> 00:21:06.870
No, I just happened to...

00:21:06.870 --> 00:21:08.530
Just happened to, huh?

00:21:08.530 --> 00:21:11.160
I bet I know what Akine-chan would say.

00:21:11.770 --> 00:21:14.220
She'd say it's karma, right?

00:21:15.310 --> 00:21:17.010
Maybe.

00:21:17.010 --> 00:21:18.880
Matsutake mushrooms!

00:21:19.310 --> 00:21:21.330
What's wrong?

00:21:21.330 --> 00:21:22.640
Matsutake!

00:21:22.760 --> 00:21:23.750
Matsutake...

00:21:24.110 --> 00:21:25.790
Out of the way.

00:21:26.060 --> 00:21:27.740
We've been waiting for this!

00:21:27.740 --> 00:21:29.590
Okay, let's get cooking!

00:21:29.590 --> 00:21:31.690
Let's get drinking!

00:21:31.690 --> 00:21:33.970
Come on, you two!

00:21:36.820 --> 00:21:38.430
Thanks!

00:23:10.960 --> 00:23:13.860
Why is Yamamoto always that way?

00:23:13.860 --> 00:23:19.250
Sometimes, humans want to 
gild who they really are.

00:23:19.250 --> 00:23:21.310
They're sad creatures, huh?

00:23:21.310 --> 00:23:24.080
Are you also hiding something, Isshiki-san?

00:23:24.080 --> 00:23:26.500
If I tell you, your life will be over!

00:23:26.500 --> 00:23:28.970
N-Never mind, I'll pass.

00:23:29.280 --> 00:23:32.050
Next time on <i>Elegant Yokai Apartment Life</i>:

00:23:32.050 --> 00:23:33.760
Under the Gilt.

00:23:32.050 --> 00:23:33.760
<b>Twentieth Haunting 
Under the Gilt</b>

00:23:34.470 --> 00:23:36.090
Yamamoto's past is...
